<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine supermarket sales rise in March.</title>
<headline>Argentine supermarket sales rise in March.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine supermarket sales in March were $887 million, 5.7 percent more than March 1996 and 18.4 percent more than February this year, said the Institute of Statistics Thursday.</p>
<p>In the first quarter of 1997, sales were 5.5 percent up on the same quarter last year.</p>
<p>The report said April is expected to show a five percent drop on March for seasonal reasons, but an eight percent rise on April last year.</p>
<p>(( -- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0695))</p>
